## Scope carve-out: `assets/`

The MIT grant above covers the source code of this plugin only.

Every file under `assets/` — the five character PNGs and `hit.mp3` — is copied
byte-for-byte from the upstream VK-1 project
(https://github.com/VKmich16/VK-1), which ships no license of its own. Those
files are redistributed here unchanged with their provenance and SHA-256 hashes
recorded in `assets/README.md`; this project grants no additional rights to
them. Confirm the terms with the upstream author before reusing them.
